{"v":1,"id":"AcyxFMQjFRhxBGm8YCkQ","createdAt":"2026-08-09T18:49:23.642Z","app":{"name":"AxiVale","version":"1.3.5"},"kind":"conversation","title":"read this report and prepare a summary focused on a single player: chromatic.2649","turns":[{"userText":"read this report and prepare a summary focused on a single player: chromatic.2649\nhttps://chromaticorb.github.io/axibridge-other/?report=20260809-151534-yly6","agentText":"\n\nI'll pull that specific run and focus on chromatic.2649.\n\nchromatic.2649 ran a heal/support Tempest. Let me pull the supporting sections to characterize their night.\n\nchromatic.2649 anchored the squad's healing and might on a heal Tempest, then flexed to a Paragon — combining for ~1.88M healing across a rough night that the squad lost 2–13.\n\n## chromatic.2649 — heal Tempest (flexed to Paragon)\n\n**Role:** Frontline heal/boon support. chromatic split the night across two builds — most of it on heal Tempest, a shorter stint on Paragon.\n\n**Healing & sustain**\n- **~1.88M total healing** — 1,295,548 on Tempest (1,273,357 to squad) + 587,855 on Paragon. Nearly all squad-directed, very little off-squad.\n- **220k of that was downed-healing** on Tempest — actively rezzing/holding people up in the bomb, not just topping off.\n- **1,309 cleanses** — one of the higher cleanse counts on the roster, exactly what you want from a frontline Tempest.\n\n**Boons provided**\n- **Primary might engine** — Tempest pumped ~11,787 squad-seconds of Might (group uptime effectively capped, i.e. permanent 25 stacks), plus another ~7,332 on Paragon. This was the squad's might backbone.\n- **Protection** (~49% group uptime on Tempest) and solid **Fury/Regen** support.\n- On the **Paragon** flex, chromatic added heavy **Stability** (160% group uptime = double-covered), **Resistance** (~80%), **Resolution** (~75%) and some **Quickness** — a genuine boon-support swap, not just a second healer.\n\n**Damage / offense** (as expected for the role, judge lightly)\n- 130,577 damage, 8,254 down-contribution — low, which is correct for a heal/boon build. Not a stat to grade here.\n\n**Survival**\n- **6 deaths, 9 downs.** Middle of the pack for a frontliner on this night — and this was a brutal fight overall.\n\n## Context — the night was rough\nThe squad went **2 wins / 13 losses** over 15 fights, with **297 squad deaths and 410 downs against just 18 enemy deaths**. In that environment chromatic's ~1.88M healing, permanent might, and 1,309 cleanses were doing real work to keep bodies up — the losses were a squad-wide problem (getting bombed and out-traded), not a support failure.\n\n**Bottom line:** chromatic pulled double duty as a healer *and* a boon-support flex — the squad's main might source, a top cleanser, and an active downed-rezzer. Solid individual support night on a night the squad got run over.\n\nWant me to compare this to chromatic's previous runs to see if this is their normal output, or pull the positioning data to see where the squad kept dying?","filedAt":"7:46 PM","tools":[{"name":"axibridge_run_summary","display":{"kind":"table","data":{"title":"Four K Ping Sil — 2W/13L over 15 fights","columns":[{"key":"account","label":"Account"},{"key":"profession","label":"Profession"},{"key":"damage","label":"Damage"},{"key":"downContribution","label":"Down contrib"},{"key":"cleanses","label":"Cleanses"},{"key":"strips","label":"Strips"},{"key":"healing","label":"Healing"},{"key":"deaths","label":"Deaths"}],"rows":[{"account":"Azulean.1728","profession":"Amalgam","damage":4524178,"downContribution":243711,"cleanses":142,"strips":12,"healing":232793,"deaths":8,"downs":12},{"account":"Alambok.5319","profession":"Druid","damage":42541,"downContribution":3476,"cleanses":2322,"strips":4,"healing":4385029,"deaths":9,"downs":10},{"account":"Sil.9715","profession":"Luminary","damage":385078,"downContribution":23156,"cleanses":491,"strips":9,"healing":839991,"deaths":7,"downs":10},{"account":"caasig.9634","profession":"Troubadour","dama